    kind: invariant  # 3062
    title: "A java wildcard import binds every unqualified class name in the file to that wildcard's package, and overrides a fully-qualified call site, so the call matches no catalogue row"  # 3062
    status: violated  # 3062
    priority: 1  # 3062
